diagnostics/builtin-method-without-parentheses.em:3:12: `upper` is a method, so it needs parentheses
  print(name.upper)
             ^^^^^
Call it, as in `.upper()`, or wrap it in a block, as in `{ value => value.upper() }`.
diagnostics/builtin-method-without-parentheses.em:4:13: `sort` is a method, so it needs parentheses
  print(names.sort)
              ^^^^
Call it, as in `.sort()`, or wrap it in a block, as in `{ value => value.sort() }`.
